# No pnpm settings live in this file.
#
# The implicit-install gate is `verifyDepsBeforeRun: warn` in pnpm-workspace.yaml:
# pnpm 11 does not honour `verify-deps-before-run` here (measured against a real
# stale lockfile), and the camelCase workspace key is the one that is read.
# Keeping this file empty also avoids the `npm warn Unknown project config` noise
# every npx call prints.